      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwilang'hana na wibeeleja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo līkasangwa likuminga ibita itaale, lya banhū mashihūmbī mingī; bishiteleja nose būyipandagīla na kwipandagīla. Ū Yesu wandya kūbawīla tame a bahemba bakwe; ūhaya gīkī, “Ilang'hanagi nī shibimbya sha Bafalisayo, ū wibeeleja wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gūtīho mhayo gūkundīkīgije, ūyo gūtūkundūlīlwa; nūūlū gwibisile, ūyo gūtūfunījiwa ha ng'wape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, īyo mukwīhoyelaga mu mbisīla īkwigwiwa hape; nī yīyo mukwihwehwetelaga mu matū, bakwīhaya n'ilaka lya kūhamuka, nīyo balī higūlya ya numba!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ūyo shiigelile kūng'ogoha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bing'we banwani bichane, nalīmuwīla mutabogohage abo bakagelelaga kūbūlaga mīlī, alīyo batī na gwa kwīta hangī a ha numa ya yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike leki namuhūgūle, nang'oolekeje ūyo shiigelile mung'ogohe. Ng'ogohagi ūyo alī na būdūla bo kūbūlaga, ha numa ya henaho kūponya mu nsango gwa moto; alichene, nalīmuwīla ng'ogohagi ū ng'wenūyo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, ī tūjū īj'itanò jitūdūla kūjinjiwa nūūlū shilingi ibīlī dūhū? Alīyo ītīho nūūlū īmò yajo īyo ītamanilwe na Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo a bing'we bene nī nzwīlī jing'we ī ja mu ntwe pyī ī jose jimanilwe ū wingī wajo. Nose hū kūhaya mutogohage, nguno a bing'we mulī ba mpango ntaale no, kūtinda ī tūjū nūūlū jikakwīla na ginehe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūnkaanīla Kilisito kū banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nalīmuwīla gīkī būlī ng'wene ūyo ūnikaanīla kū būtongi bo banhū, nū Ng'wana wa Munhū akūnkaanīla ū kū būtongi bo bamalaika ba ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūyo ūnilema kū būtongi bo banhū, nang'hwe akūleng'wa ū kū būtongi bo bamalaika ba ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nīyo munhū ose ose ashikile kūlekejiwa nūūlū akang'haya kībi ū Ng'wana wa Munhū, alīyo ūyo ūgima kūnsondagūla Moyo Ng'wela, ū ng'wenūyo atīko ū kūlekejiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī nūūlū būmutwala mu masinagogi, nūūlū kūmushisha kū būtongi bo basugi na bataale, yaya ū kwandya kwiganika ganika ūmo mulashokeje, nūūlū ūmo mulasomboolele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo ū Moyo Ng'wela akūmulanga īyo yigeleelilwe ng'wīsomboole.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūsumo lo nsabi mbūūlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitulwa ū ng'wibita lya banhū, munhū nebe wang'wīla gīkī, “Nangi nalī na ng'wanong'wise, ng'wīlage aninhe nane ū ngabo go wingīji!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, “Bebe nani ūyo wanitūūlile ū nene kūbiza namuji nūūlū ngabanhya a ha gatī ying'we?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla gīkī, “Ikalagi miso; nīyo ilang'hanagi nayo pyī ī mihayo ya kwikūmva, nguno ū būpanga bo ng'wa munhū būtī mu wingī bo shikolo īsho alī nasho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya henaho ūbawīla lūsumo ūhaya gīkī, “Ngūnda gwa nsabi nebe gūkapya chiza, ūpona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū wandya kwideedeng'hanya aliwīla gīkī, ‘Alīyo ī gete, nīīte ginehe īkī nalīgayiwa a ha kwītūūla ī mhona yane yenīyī!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ohaya, ‘Yū ī gete gūyū ū gwa kwīta: Nakūbasambagūla pye a bana maluuli bane, nabeeje gangī mapya, nīyo mataale; nakumingīle ng'wenūmo pyī ī shilīwa nī sabo yane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū nūmala ū kwīta gīko niwīla gīkī, “Haho lūūlū būpanga bone, ūlī na shikolo shingī shawiza sha kūtūmamīla myaka mingī; ifuulage ūlye na kūng'wa, ūyege!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Alīyo ū Mulungu akang'wīla gīkī, ‘Bebe mbūūlī, ī gīsī īkī ū būjikū bo lelo wenūbū bakūkwīngīja ū būpanga wako, ī shikolo shenīshi wibīkīlaga shikūbiza sha ng'wa nani?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo alī būlī ng'wene ūyo akibīkīlaga sabo jakwe wei ng'wenekīlī, alīyo ū kūlī Mulungu atī na sabo yose yose!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkoya koyela ya būpanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūbawīla a bahemba bakwe gīkī, “Kūlwa nguno yenīyo nalīmuwīla yaya ū kwikala mukūkoya koyelaga būpanga, gīkī mukūlya kī, nūūlū mibīlī ying'we, gīkī mukūzwala kī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū būpanga būlī būtaale kūtinda shilīwa, nū mīlī gūshiheebile ī shizwalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alijiganikīlagi ī noni, ī joi jitabībaga nūūlū jitagesaga, na hangī jitī na numba ya kūbīkīla shilīwa, nūūlū jitī na maluuli; alīyo ū Mulungu akajilishaga. A bing'we mujikīlile kūle no ī noni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī alīho nani nūūlū ūmò wing'we ūyo adūgije kwiyongeleleja ī likanza lya būlamu bokwe kūlwa kwiyanga yangīla wei ng'wenekīlī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūlū mutadūgije nūūlū kūgwīta ū mhayo ū ndo gwenūyū, nibūlī īkūmukoyaga ī yīngī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aligiganikīlagi nūūlū mabonji ūmo gakakūlīlaga; a goyi gatatūmamaga, nūūlū shizwalo gatabeejaga; alīyo nalīmuwīla gīkī nūūlū ū Solomoni hamò n'ikūjo lyakwe pyī ī lyose ūmo lyalī, walī atadūgije kūzwalīla chiza kūshisha kūlenganīla nūūlū na līmò lyago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we ba kūzunya kūdo, ū Mulungu ūyo akazwalīkaga maswa ga mu matogolo chiza gīko, ayo galīho ī lelo alīyo a ha ntondo gaponyiwa mu moto, angū a bing'we atūdūla kūng'wītīla mitaale kūtinda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, oyagi ū kwikala mukūkoya koyaga kūkooba īsho mulalye, nūūlū īsho mulang'we; yaya ū kwikala ng'weneng'halaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pye a ba mu sī abo bataamanile Mulungu hū bene abo bakakoya koyaga kūshikooba ī shenīshi; alīyo a bing'we, ū Sīng'we amanile gīkī shing'wigeleelilwe mubize nasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya būkoobagi tame ū būtemi bokwe, nī shose īshi mukongejiwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsabi bo ng'wigūlū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A bing'we ī chene mulī idale ido, gwike mutogohage, nguno ū Sīng'we gūnyegije gwa kūng'winha ū būtemi a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jinjagi ī shikolo shing'we mufunye manong'ho, ng'wibeegeje mbogoshi jitī ja kūkūlūhala; mubize na wibīkīja wa būja na būja ng'wigūlū, ūko ng'wibi atīko kwegeela, nūūlū fufuuji jitūdūla kūkenaagūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno aho ūbisīlile ī sabo yako, nīng'holò yako īlolelile henaho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basese bachagūku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Itungagi ī mikīmbīlī, nī tala jing'we jibize jilībaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubize gītī banhū banindīīlile saabo būgonzo, kūshisha aho alashokele kūfuma kū būkombe. Ūlū ūshika ha nyango ūkomagula, haho na haho būnugūlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūbiza na lubango a basese benabo, ū saabo būgonzo ūlū ūbasanga balī miso; nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana, akwitunga abinhe ha kwigasha, hūna abalonja longeje shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adūgije kwiza hīīlū, nūūlū būjikū ha gatī, alīyo īkūbiza lubango no ū kū basese benabo ūlū ūbasanga balī miso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike managi gīkī ū namugī ha ng'wakwe ūlū ni walīdeeba ī likanza lya kwiza kwa ng'wibi ni atīlekanīgije ī numba yakwe īkambagūlwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, na a bing'we ikalagi nzūgūlū matū, nguno ū Ng'wana wa Munhū akwiza ng'wikanza īlo mutūliganikīlaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Batūmami ba mbika ibīlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Petelo ūbūja, “Seeba ūlītūwīla bise dūhū ū lūsumo lwenūlū, nūūlū ūlībawīla pye na a bangī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Seeba ūhaya, “Ī gīsī nani ū mīkījiwa ū nsanyiwa na ng'witegeleja, ūyo ashikile kūtūūlwa na ise būgonzo ha nīmo gwa kūbagabanhya batūmami ba ha kaya mheela jabo ng'wikanza īlo ligeleelilwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsese ūyo ūsangwa nū ise būgonzo akwītaga ūmo alagīlilwe, akūbiza alī na lubango no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla go ng'hana gīkī, ū ise būgonzo akūntūūla ha būtaale bo shikolo shakwe shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nsese ng'wenūyo ūlū wandya kwiwīla ū mung'holò yakwe gīkī, ‘Yū wadīlile no nīyo ū baba būgonzo!’ Hūna ūlinhya kūyūbatūlagūla a batūmami ba ha sīlīlī yakwe, bagosha na bakīma; na kūyūjilya na kūjing'wela ī sabo, wayūdīla aleebilwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū ise būgonzo wa nsese ng'wenūyo akwiza mu lūshikū ūlo atalwiganikīlile, n'ikanza īlo atalīmanile. Ūlū ūshika akūmutagūla mapingili mapingili, nū ngabo gokwe agūtūūle ng'wigele lya bagomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ū nsese ūyo ayīmanile īyo ise būgonzo atogilwe yītwe, alīyo ūleka ū kwīdīlīla nūūlū kwīyīta, akūtūlwa hataale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūyo wīta mu būtūmana mihayo īyo yigeleelilwe nsango gwa kūtūlwa, ū ng'wene akūtūlwa hado. Ūyo winhwa shingī akūlomva shingī, nū yūyo abīkījiwe shingī kūtinda, nang'hwe bakūnomba shingī kūtinda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wilemeelwa kūlwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū nene nizile kūponeja moto ū mu sī, nose ī ng'hūmbū jane jilī gīkī ūlū ni gūlībaka ī haha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalī na būbatīījiwa ūbo shinigeleelilwe kūbatījiwa; alīyo ū mhayo gwenūyū gūlīnikoya no kūshisha gūshikīīle! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muliganika nenhile mhola ū mu sī? Ītī gīko na hado yaya; nenhile wilemeelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno kūfuma ikanza īlī, banhū batanò bakwikala mu kaya īmò; alīyo bakūbiza balekanile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū namhala akwilemeelwa na ng'witūnja okwe, nū ng'witūnja akwilemeelwa nū ise; ū ngikūlū nang'hwe akwilemeelwa na nshīke okwe, nū nshīke akwilemeelwa nū nina. Hangī ū ngikūlū akwilemeelwa na ng'wīnga okwe; ū ng'wīnga nang'hwe akwilemeelwa nū nina būkwi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlitegeleja ikanza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a mabita ga banhū ūgawīla gīkī, “Ūlū ng'wabona ilunde lyabūūka ū kū ng'weli haho na haho mukahayaga, ‘Lelo īkūtūla mbula;’ na ng'hana yaja chene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū gwahemba nyaga gūfumile mu dakama nahene mukahayaga, ‘Lelo ī līīmi līkūseba’ ng'hana gwashikīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we bibeeleja, ng'wakūyūmanīja kagalūkīle ka sī na malunde, alīyo ī likanza īlī ī lyene ni ginehe līmulemeelile ū kūlīmanīja?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwiyangūla na ng'wilemeelwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nibūlī a bing'we mulemeelilwe ū kūbūbona ū būtūngīlīja ū mu kalamulīle king'we benekīlī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū ūlī na ng'wilemeelwa wako mujile kūlī namuji, shiigelile ūbeeje masala masoga aho mutaalī mu nzīla, ūwīnje ū wilemeelwa; wiyigwe nang'hwe kūko ataalī kūkūshisha ū kūlī namuji. Nguno ū namuji akūkūtūūla mu makono ga nshilikale, nang'hwe ū nshilikale akūkūponya mu jeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīkūwīla ūtalafuma mo nūūlū hado, aho ūtaalī kūmala kūlīpa kūshisha senti ya kūmalīja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.59"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
